FTCS                 tau = h**2*kappa*u_xxxx*(6*r - 1)/12
BTCS                 tau = -h**2*kappa*u_xxxx*(6*r + 1)/12
Crank-Nicolson       tau = -dt**2*kappa**3*u_xxxxxx/12 - h**2*kappa*u_xxxx/12
upwind               tau = c*h*u_xx*(nu - 1)/2
Lax-Friedrichs       tau = c*h*u_xx*(nu - 1)*(nu + 1)/(2*nu)
Lax-Wendroff         tau = -c*h**2*u_xxx*(nu - 1)*(nu + 1)/6
leapfrog (transport) tau = -c*h**2*u_xxx*(nu - 1)*(nu + 1)/6
leapfrog (wave)      tau = c**2*h**2*u_xxxx*(nu - 1)*(nu + 1)/12
3u_t+4u_x+u=0 (CTCS) tau = dt**2*u_ttt/2 + 2*h**2*u_xxx/3
